  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──悪いけど、収録が始まったら\r\n俺は別件で少し離れることになってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "愛依、大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020010,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……トーゼン！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020020,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "プロデューサーが、俺がいなくても、もう大丈夫だな……\r\nなーんてしんみりしちゃうくらいに完璧にやったげるから！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、頼もしいな\r\nでも、何かあったら、遠慮しないで連絡してくれ",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020030,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うん、わかってるって！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020040,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "…………\r\n和泉愛依は、うちとプロデューサーで作ったアイドル……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020050,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……だから、プロデューサーが離れてる時も……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020060,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "いつだって……\r\nプロデューサーと一緒に仕事してるってことだと思うんだ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020070,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "だから、全然寂しいとか、不安とかないし！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは……\r\n俺の方が寂しくなっちゃうかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020080,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "え～\r\nプロデューサー可愛いとこあんじゃ～ん",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020090,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "アハハ、\r\n寂しくなったらいつでも連絡していいからね～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうさせてもらおうかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020100,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "マジ？\r\nうちでいいならいつでも大歓迎だし～",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020110,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "愛依？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020120,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……うちってさ、最初アイドルなんてマジ無理！\r\nってカンジだったじゃん？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020130,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "でもプロデューサー、こんなうちでも『もう無理！』\r\nってならないで、ちゃんと見てくれて……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020140,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "しかも、上手くやる方法まで考えてくれて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900202/1019002020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002020150,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "それで、今のうちがいるわけっしょ？",
